  "details": "I'm using google translate.\nHello, I am always having fun with vrchat.\nThere was an update today, but in my environment, the social friends section doesn't update at all after logging in.\nAlso, I haven't received friend notifications, invite notifications, or request invite notifications in the game since the unity2019 update came in.\nI am in great trouble because I cannot disable the ipv6 environment.\nCurrently, the only way to check it is from a browser, which is very troublesome.\nI think it's a busy place, but I would appreciate it if you could respond.",
